  "constraints": [
    "Preserve tracked working-tree changes in addition to a Git bundle. Git bundle excludes local Git config and avoids copying credential-bearing config.",
    "Server root untracked engine-mirror files are mainly zero-byte placeholders: src/source_lists/scons/utils contain no source bytes. Preserve source under tracked engine/.",
    "Do not recursively include ignored build/audit directories: disposable databases, generated identity keys and retained native results are mixed with diagnostics. Select reports/scripts explicitly.",
    "Python3.12.10 source pin is fixed; historical image tags containing python3.14 are retained image names, not the interpreter used for current tests.",
    "Windows dependency wheels differ from Linux CPython3.12 wheels. Keep the 17 Linux wheels as an exact offline wheelhouse, and the three cp312 Windows replacement wheels if retaining Windows cache.",
    "Build source paths and installed Python scripts contain absolute locations. Recreate prefixes at the new desired root or preserve the prior internal mount layout.",
    "MongoDB8.0.32 verification binary requires modern GLIBC; the existing Mongo verification container is compatible. Do not assume Debian bookworm compatibility.",
    "Tests require disposable single-node replica-set Mongo on loopback and nofile65536. ALLIANCE_TEST_MONGO_URI is a test-only URI; never point it at Windows game runtime.",
    "Native protocol/real combat checks require rebuilt account bridge/full native engine and original game-data inputs from the client; Python unit success alone is incomplete verification.",
    "Dockerfiles use pinned base digests but apt package versions are not completely pinned. Per user direction, no Docker image exports are included. Recipes alone produce a newly resolved OS package layer that must be verified.",
    "No production .env, private runtime, credential file or database was opened; no workspace mutation or deletion performed."
  ],
